# Original Nightwire magazine

An explicitly loaded local starter edition for the [magazine reader](../../docs/board-magazine.md).
All included text/ASCII is original Faction BBS project material under BSD-3-Clause.
This supplies no third-party artwork, file bytes or contributor-authentication proof.

The pack enables only its local magazine when a sysop chooses it with `--library`
or the shared-service `library` setting. It provides no file download reference;
use `faction library-edition PACK signal-001 NEW_FILE`, then the ordinary reviewed
file workflow if you want one. Preserve each released revision and permission
records outside the database backup. Drafts/submissions stay private until reviewed.
